# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Below, the bytes ARE the contract, so checkout must not rewrite line endings.
#
# tests/fixtures holds captured server responses that are compared byte for
# byte, and one of them by sha256; a Windows checkout that turned its LFs into
# CRLFs changed the hash and failed the suite while the library was fine.
# LICENSE and NOTICE travel verbatim into every wheel and sdist, and
# scripts/verify_distribution.py compares the archive members against these
# files, so they must be the same bytes on every platform that builds.
tests/fixtures/** -text
LICENSE -text
NOTICE -text
